Package: com.ratush.appsplitvpn
Name: App Split VPN
Version: 0.4.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Per-app VPN/DIRECT routing, experimental MULTI VPN with app-to-profile matrix and verified public IP per tunnel. Extra: ordered VPN redundancy, health checks, Always ON and lock-screen disconnect with optional music/PiP protection. MULTI currently requires different unmanaged PacketTunnel providers; one profile per VPN app. Install range: iOS 15.0 - 26.0.1 (rootless); runtime verified on iOS 17.0 only. Red BYPASS, green TUNNEL ONLY, blue MULTI VPN:N badge follows native status-bar visibility.
Maintainer: ratush
Author: ratush
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<= 26.0.1), preferenceloader, com.opa334.ccsupport, libroot-dopamine, mobilesubstrate | ellekit
